    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this fantastic one-bedroom, own door apartment to the market, ideally located within a private and secure development just off the North Circular Road in Dublin 7\nThe location of Rathdown Square is second to none, just a short stroll from the ever-popular Stoneybatter, renowned for its vibrant community and excellent selection of artisan shops, delis, bakeries, cafés, and restaurants. A range of supermarkets including Lidl, are also nearby, offering convenience. The Phoenix Park is within a 10-minute walk. Commuting to the city centre is easy, whether by foot or public transport. Heuston Station is close by, along with LUAS stops at Phibsborough, Broadstone, and Grangegorman. Multiple bus routes run along the North Circular Road, and the nearby M50 ensures swift access to Dublin Airport and beyond. Technological University Dublin (TUD) campus at Grangegorman is also within walking distance.\nBright and spacious internal living accommodation of c. 40 sq.m comprises of an entrance hallway with storage closet, living room with feature fireplace and a separate fully fitted kitchen, bathroom and a double bedroom with built in wardrobes. This fantastic property is presented in great condition and boasts double-glazed windows, a designated parking space to the front, private patio to the front with a south facing aspect and the added security of a gated development.\nAn opportunity not to be missed; Contact the agent at our Northside office on 01-6995050 or 086-0469458 for further information or to arrange viewing!!\n\nAdditional Features:\n<ul>\n <li>c. 40 sq.m</li>\n <li>One Bedroom | One Bathroom</li>\n <li>Own door apartment</li>\n <li>BER C</li>\n <li>Designated parking space</li>\n <li>Secure and Gated development</li>\n <li>Double-glazed windows throughout</li>\n <li>Walking distance to local shops and amenities</li>\n <li>The Mater Hospital and the City Centre are within easy reach</li>\n <li>Excellent public transport links nearby</li>\n <li>Excellent location with Stoneybatter within walking distance</li>\n <li>Local amenities within walking distance</li>\n <li>Easy access to Dublin City Centre</li>\n <li>Property will be 2 years vacant in April 2027</li>\n <li>Ideal for first time buyers and investors</li>\n <li>Early viewing highly advised!!</li>\n</ul>\n\nDirections:\nTravelling on North Circular Road toward Great Western Avenue, Rathdown Square is located on your left-hand side. Take the first right and No 29 Rathdown Square is located on your right-hand side."
      },
      {
